---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import SubscribeForm from '../components/SubscribeForm.astro';
---
<Base title="About · Nick Major" description="Nick Major is a software engineer in Lisbon who builds products with AI and is learning distribution in public.">
  <div class="wrap">
    <section class="about">
      <img class="about__face" src="/nicholas-major.jpg" width="200" height="200" alt="Nick Major" />
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">About</span>
        <h1 class="phead__title">I'm Nick.</h1>
        <div class="prose about__body">
          <p>I've been building software for about fifteen years, and spent four of them teaching it. I live in Lisbon.</p>
          <p>For most of that time I was good at the building and bad at everything after it. I'd ship something, tell a few friends, and wonder why nobody showed up. Plenty of developers know that feeling.</p>
          <p>So now I'm working on the other half. I build my own <a href="/projects/">products</a>, mostly with AI, and treat marketing like an engineering problem: try something, measure it, automate the boring parts, write down what happened. The results go up here and in my newsletter, the flops included.</p>
          <p>I also build marketing tools for myself. When one is good enough for other people, the people reading along will hear about it first.</p>
          <p>Older writing on applied AI and engineering is in the <a href="/archive/">archive</a>.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="about__links">
          <a href="https://x.com/thenmajor" target="_blank" rel="me noopener">X</a>
          <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/nmajor" target="_blank" rel="me noopener">LinkedIn</a>
          <a href="https://github.com/nmajor" target="_blank" rel="me noopener">GitHub</a>
          <a href="https://www.instagram.com/thenmajor" target="_blank" rel="me noopener">Instagram</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="card nlbox">
      <strong>Deploy to Humans</strong>
      <p>My weekly newsletter: one experiment, what happened, and the tools I used.</p>
      <SubscribeForm id="form-about" source="about" />
    </section>
  </div>
  <style>
    .about { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 200px 1fr; gap: 48px; padding: clamp(28px, 5vw, 56px) 0 0; align-items: start; }
    .about__face { width: 200px; height: 200px; border-radius: 50%; object-fit: cover; border: 6px solid #fff; box-shadow: 9px 9px 0 var(--accent); }
    .about__body { max-width: 640px; }
    .about__links { display: flex; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 8px; }
    .about__links a { border: 2px solid var(--ink); border-radius: 999px; padding: 6px 14px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; background: #fff; }
    .about__links a:hover { background: var(--yellow); }
    .nlbox { margin-top: 48px; padding: 26px; }
    .nlbox strong { font-family: var(--display); font-size: 26px; }
    .nlbox p { margin: 6px 0 0; color: var(--muted); }
    @media (max-width: 760px) {
      .about { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 24px; }
      .about__face { width: 140px; height: 140px; }
    }
  </style>
</Base>
